# Agent Lessons

Purpose:
- preserve reusable lessons from agent work in this repository
- reduce repeated mistakes across future Codex, Copilot, Claude, or human-assisted sessions

Rules:
- Keep lessons specific and actionable.
- Include symptoms, cause, and fix when possible.
- Do not store secrets, credentials, or private user data.
- Promote durable lessons into workflow docs when they become standard practice.

## Lesson Template

```md
### YYYY-MM-DD - Short lesson title

Applies to:
